          <section>
          
<div class="wrapper3">
<p class="fwb">Organizers: Japan Pair Go Association / World Pair Go Association<br> Cooperation: The All-Japan Students Go Association</p>
<p class="mt10"> We are holding the 2nd World Students Pair Go Championship.<br> 32 players (15 university student pairs and one high school student pair) from 11 countries and territories will be competing. </p>

<table class="tablephoto fs25 fwb mb0 mt30">
<tr>
<td colspan="2" class="align_c">
Lew &amp; Choi pair (Korea)! Congratulations!</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="2">
<img src="../../common/img/26th/winner_student.jpg" alt="" width="565" height="400"></td>
</tr>
</table>
</div>


